# Gideon, Battle-Forged: "0: Until end of turn, Gideon becomes a 4/4 Human Soldier creature with indestructible that's
# still a planeswalker. Prevent all damage that would be dealt to him this turn" (CR 613.1d, 615.1, 306.8). On turn 5 the 0
# keeps his 3 loyalty; Bot1's own Lightning Bolt and Bot2's in response are both prevented, and so is the combat damage of
# Bot2's Dwarven Mauler blocking him, which his 4 power kills. On turn 6 he is a planeswalker alone again, and a Bolt is
# no longer prevented: his 3 loyalty are gone and he is put into the graveyard (CR 704.5i).

